'' RUN: a boolean bitfield reads as a signed byte, -1 when set: 'sizeof( x.a )' is 1,
'' 'x.a - 2' is -3, and 'if x.a = -1' is taken. It read 1, typed UINTEGER.
'' Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/bitfield-boolean.bas -o tests/codegen/bitfieldboolean.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/bitfieldboolean.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1             -3            -1            -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1
